<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>My Little Universe</title>
  <style>
    body {
      background: #100d1c;
      color: #f5eaff;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 60px 20px;
    }
    h1 {
      color: #d6a8ff;
      font-size: 42px;
    }
    p {
      color: #c9bfd9;
      font-size: 18px;
    }
    button {
      background: #b783ff;
      color: #160c25;
      border: none;
      padding: 12px 22px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      cursor: pointer;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>✨ My Little Universe ✨</h1>
  <p>A little space for creativity, dreams, and learning.</p>
  <button onclick="alert('Welcome to my universe! 💜')">
    Enter My Universe
  </button>
</body>
